                                            h2.fw-bolder FortisPro
                                            p FortisPro is a property investment tracker that enables users granular control of their costs, investments, and planning. Some incredible features will be releasing soon that we cannot share too much on at the moment.
                                            a.text-gradient(href='https://fortispro.fusiontree.co.za/index.html') Check it out
                                        img.img-fluid(style='max-height: 400px; max-width: 300px; margin-top: 10px;' src='assets/fortispro.png', alt='...')

